<section class="sec"><div class="wrap"><div class="tcards"><a class="tcard rv" href="/policyholder-calculators/appraisal-payoff-estimator/"><span class="tcard-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/calculator.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/calculator-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/calculator.webp 1024w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 40vw, 220px" width="1024" height="734" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><i>Δ</i></span><span class="tcard-b"><small>Calculator</small><h2>Appraisal Payoff Estimator</h2><p>Size the dispute, test where an award might land and subtract realistic fees to see your net.</p></span></a><a class="tcard rv" href="/policyholder-calculators/depreciation-recovery-calculator/"><span class="tcard-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/paperwork.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/paperwork-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/paperwork.webp 960w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 40vw, 220px" width="960" height="720" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><i>ACV</i></span><span class="tcard-b"><small>Calculator</small><h2>Depreciation Recovery Calculator</h2><p>Estimate the first ACV check, the depreciation held back and the total after repairs.</p></span></a><a class="tcard rv" href="/policyholder-calculators/roof-slope-factor-calculator/"><span class="tcard-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/roofer.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/roofer-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/roofer.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 40vw, 220px" width="1200" height="900" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><i>◭</i></span><span class="tcard-b"><small>Calculator</small><h2>Roof Squares &amp; Slope Factor Calculator</h2><p>Turn a footprint and pitch into roof squares, order quantities and a rough replacement figure.</p></span></a><a class="tcard rv" href="/policyholder-calculators/hail-percentage-deductible-calculator/"><span class="tcard-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/hailstones.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/hailstones-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/hailstones.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 40vw, 220px" width="1200" height="900" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><i>%</i></span><span class="tcard-b"><small>Calculator</small><h2>Hail Percentage Deductible Calculator</h2><p>Convert a wind/hail percentage deductible into dollars and compare it with a flat deductible.</p></span></a><a class="tcard rv" href="/policyholder-calculators/appraisal-calendar-builder/"><span class="tcard-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/calendar-desk.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/calendar-desk-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/calendar-desk.webp 1024w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 40vw, 220px" width="1024" height="685" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><i>◷</i></span><span class="tcard-b"><small>Planner</small><h2>Appraisal Calendar Builder</h2><p>Build a claim and appraisal timeline from your date of loss and export it to your calendar.</p></span></a><a class="tcard rv" href="/policyholder-calculators/claim-file-readiness-grader/"><span class="tcard-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/inspector.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/inspector-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/inspector.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 40vw, 220px" width="1200" height="799" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><i>A+</i></span><span class="tcard-b"><small>Checklist</small><h2>Claim File Readiness Grader</h2><p>Answer twelve questions and get a letter grade plus a to-do list before you demand appraisal.</p></span></a><a class="tcard rv" href="/policyholder-calculators/coinsurance-penalty-calculator/"><span class="tcard-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/metal-barn.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/metal-barn-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/metal-barn.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 40vw, 220px" width="1200" height="900" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><i>÷</i></span><span class="tcard-b"><small>Calculator</small><h2>Coinsurance Penalty Calculator</h2><p>See whether underinsurance could shrink a farm, commercial or HOA payment, and by how much.</p></span></a></div></div></section>
<section class="sec tint"><div class="wrap split">
<div class="rv"><p class="kicker">Suggested order</p><h2>Using the calculators together</h2><ol class="steps-list"><li>Start with the <a href="/policyholder-calculators/appraisal-calendar-builder/">appraisal calendar builder</a> so no deadline slips.</li><li>Check quantities with the <a href="/policyholder-calculators/roof-slope-factor-calculator/">roof squares and slope factor calculator</a>.</li><li>See what you’re owed with the <a href="/policyholder-calculators/hail-percentage-deductible-calculator/">hail deductible</a> and <a href="/policyholder-calculators/depreciation-recovery-calculator/">depreciation recovery</a> calculators.</li><li>Farm or commercial? Run the <a href="/policyholder-calculators/coinsurance-penalty-calculator/">coinsurance penalty calculator</a>.</li><li>Test the dispute with the <a href="/policyholder-calculators/appraisal-payoff-estimator/">appraisal payoff estimator</a>, then grade your file with the <a href="/policyholder-calculators/claim-file-readiness-grader/">readiness grader</a>.</li></ol></div>
<div class="rv"><div class="box box-call"><h2 class="box-t">Talk it through first</h2><p>The first conversation is free. We’ll tell you plainly whether appraisal fits your claim.</p><a class="big-tel" href="tel:+18445371427">+1 (844) 537-1427</a><a class="btn ink" href="/get-a-claim-review/">Send claim details</a></div></div></div></section>
</main>
